OL,5,
OL,6,FThe homeowner was one of those
OL,7,Fevacuated on the day of the fire and
OL,8,Fthey then returned home over the
OL,9,Fweekend to find items missing,
OL,10,Fincluding jewellery, watches and a coin
OL,11,Fcollection, detectives said.
